# Provenance addon: everything data-shaped stays on the machine.
# state.json names every repository on the disk, app.html embeds it, and
# decisions.json describes unresolved private decisions. This remote is public.
provenance/state.json
provenance/app.html
provenance/decisions.json
provenance/preview/

# Folders served to a phone for review. chuuwork/ is a local mirror of the
# ChuuMind site so its pages can be read on a device while they are being
# worked on; public/tools/ is an older copy of the same idea. Both are other
# projects' bytes sitting in this working tree and neither belongs to this
# repository. Delete them freely; the server only needs whatever it is pointed at.
/chuuwork/
/public/tools/
